 beatmaps in mind. It results in high sync between sound and gameplay – you'll feel it! <br>Music themes are inspired by different genres such as EDM, K-POP, Drum’n’Bass, Disco, Lo-fi hip-hop, even Metal, and much more. <br><br><strong>A WACKY STORY TO FOLLOW</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1475840/extras/695ff0b02ee2a1f18b882c8f70bb2c95.poster.avif?t=1739398889\" width=616 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1475840/extras/695ff0b02ee2a1f18b882c8f70bb2c95.webm?t=1739398889\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1475840/extras/695ff0b02ee2a1f18b882c8f70bb2c95.mp4?t=1739398889\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Follow Sprout - the Chosen Onion - on his lightweight and self-aware adventure between music levels. Make funny dialogue interactions, full of silly jokes and pop culture references. Help the adorable inhabitants of the Vegetable Kingdom and face a charming cast of Sweet Villains.<br><br><strong>INFINITE REPLAYABILITY AND CHALLENGE WITH LEVEL MODIFIERS</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1475840/extras/07bd0b3648cc616b4e056d577df6a63d.poster.avif?t=1739398889\" width=600 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1475840/extras/07bd0b3648cc616b4e056d577df6a63d.webm?t=1739398889\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1475840/extras/07bd0b3648cc616b4e056d577df6a63d.mp4?t=1739398889\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Aside from difficulty modes and highscore achievements, there are several modifiers to ramp up the 